f_required":true,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["alerting","graphing","hacktoberfest","metrics","monitoring","prometheus","time-series"],"visibility":"public","forks":10224,"open_issues":763,"watchers":63109,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"### What did you do?\r\n\r\nUpgraded from v2.45.0 to v2.46.0 was the only change initially. Running with the latest docker image. \r\n\r\n### What did you expect to see?\r\n\r\nThe same, if not improved resource usage after the upgrade\r\n\r\n### What did you see instead? Under which circumstances?\r\n\r\nImmediately after the upgrade, increased CPU and Memory usage. Query engine timings were also slower. Both memory and queries increased over time too. \r\n\r\nDisabling the `native-histograms` feature flag, at the point highlighted by cursor in the below screenshot, returned everything to expected behaviour. \r\n\r\nHere's a chart for reference. ![Chart for reference](https://cdn.zappy.app/d697c886a4f3fc98a3326bd487d1c12a.png)\r\n\r\n\r\n### System information\r\n\r\nLinux 5.4.0-155-generic x86_64\r\n\r\n### Prometheus version\r\n\r\n```text\r\nprometheus, version 2.46.0 (branch: HEAD, revision: cbb69e51423565ec40f46e74f4ff2dbb3b7fb4f0)\r\n  build user:       root@42454fc0f41e\r\n  build date:       20230725-12:31:24\r\n  go version:       go1.20.6\r\n  platform:         linux/amd64\r\n  tags:             netgo,builtinassets,stringlabels\r\n```\r\n\r\nFirst few log lines too, containing similar info\r\n\r\n```\r\nts=2023-07-25T22:18:15.689Z caller=main.go:585 level=info msg=\"Starting Prometheus Server\" mode=server version=\"(version=2.46.0, branch=HEAD, revision=cbb69e51423565ec40f46e74f4ff2dbb3b7fb4f0)\"\r\nts=2023-07-25T22:18:15.693Z caller=main.go:590 level=info build_context=\"(go=go1.20.6, platform=linux/amd64, user=root@42454fc0f41e, date=20230725-12:31:24, tags=netgo,builtinassets,stringlabels)\"\r\nts=2023-07-25T22:18:15.694Z caller=main.go:591 level=info host_details=\"(Linux 5.4.0-155-generic #172-Ubuntu SMP Fri Jul 7 16:10:02 UTC 2023 x86_64 bcb52a8c481e (none))\"\r\nts=2023-07-25T22:18:15.694Z caller=main.go:592 level=info fd_limits=\"(soft=1048576, hard=1048576)\"\r\nts=2023-07-25T22:18:15.698Z caller=main.go:593 level=info vm_limits=\"(soft=unlimited, hard=unlimited)\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n### Prometheus configuration file\r\n\r\nI don't believe config file is relevant but can provide if requested. Flags passed to Prometheus below. Removing `--enable-feature=native-histograms` fixed the issue\r\n\r\n```yaml\r\ncommand:\r\n  - \"--config.file=/etc/prometheus/prometheus.yml\"\r\n  - \"--storage.tsdb.path=/prometheus\"\r\n  - \"--storage.tsdb.retention.time=3d\"\r\n  - \"--storage.tsdb.retention.size=75GB\"\r\n  - \"--storage.tsdb.min-block-duration=2h\"\r\n  - \"--storage.tsdb.max-block-duration=2h\"\r\n  - \"--web.enable-lifecycle\"\r\n  - \"--web.enable-admin-api\"\r\n  - \"--web.page-title=REDACTED\"\r\n  - \"--web.external-url=REDACTED\"\r\n  - \"--enable-feature=native-histograms\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Alertmanager version\r\n\r\n```text\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n### Alertmanager configuration file\r\n\r\n```yaml\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n### Logs\r\n\r\nPotentially related - logs from startup after disabling native-histogram feature flag. \r\n\r\n```text\r\nts=2023-07-25T22:18:16.560Z caller=head.go:595 level=info component=tsdb msg=\"Replaying on-disk memory mappable chunks if any\"\r\nts=2023-07-25T22:18:17.460Z caller=head.go:661 level=error component=tsdb msg=\"Loading on-disk chunks failed\" err=\"iterate on on-disk chunks: out of sequence m-mapped chunk for series ref 18120713, last chunk: [1690321802579, 1690322397587], new: [1690321802579, 1690322397587]\"\r\nts=2023-07-25T22:18:17.461Z caller=head.go:901 level=info component=tsdb msg=\"Deleting mmapped chunk files\"\r\nts=2023-07-25T22:18:17.479Z caller=head.go:907 level=info component=tsdb msg=\"Deleting mmapped chunk files\"\r\nts=2023-07-25T22:18:17.480Z caller=head.go:910 level=info component=tsdb msg=\"Deletion of corrupted mmap chunk files failed, discarding chunk files completely\" err=\"cannot handle error: iterate on on-disk chunks: out of sequence m-mapped chunk for series ref 18120713, last chunk: [1690321802579, 1690322397587], new: [1690321802579, 1690322397587]\"\r\nts=2023-07-25T22:18:17.564Z caller=head.go:676 level=info component=tsdb msg=\"On-disk memory mappable chunks replay completed\" duration=1.003443018s\r\n```\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/issues/12603/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/issues/12603/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":10159663114,"node_id":"AE_lADOAGhaic5u0G2ZzwAAAAJdkCgK","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/issues/events/10159663114","actor":{"login":"beorn7","id":5609886,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MDk4ODY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5609886?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beorn7","html_url":"https://github.com/beorn7","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beorn7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beorn7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beorn7/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beorn7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beorn7/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beorn7/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beorn7/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beorn7/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beorn7/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":f